                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="17865926" author="JIRAUSER294653" created="Mon, 15 Jul 2024 07:37:28 +0000"  >&lt;h1&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;RootCause&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Root Cause&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The reason for this problem is that the checkpoint file generated during the streaming segment building process was mistakenly deleted during the automatic garbage cleanup process, which caused the newly generated segment to automatically start building from 0, thus creating an overlap in scope with the previous segment, resulting in a checksum error being reported.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17865927" author="JIRAUSER294653" created="Mon, 15 Jul 2024 07:39:32 +0000"  >&lt;h1&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;DevDesign&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Dev Design&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/attachment/13070163/13070163_8849.1.png&quot; height=&quot;112&quot; width=&quot;609&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Note: After discussion, modifying the directory name itself risks triggering the segment overlap issue and does not guarantee reliability in scenarios such as accidental deletion, so the fix is abandoned;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;On the other hand, we need to detect the mods that have already gone wrong and mark them as broken to avoid query hits on this type of segment;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/attachment/13070164/13070164_8849.2.png&quot; height=&quot;178&quot; width=&quot;562&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17865959" author="jira-bot" created="Mon, 15 Jul 2024 08:30:32 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Commit 3ef254379f6a93f1208d4610fc85f6d30bc30621 in kylin&apos;s branch refs/heads/kylin5 from Hongrong Cao &#26361;&#40511;&#33635;&lt;br/&gt;
